WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:10.432
I miss Dad and Hada.

2
00:00:10.433 --> 00:00:15.949
I wonder how they're doing?

3
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:18.259
Sunny: Do you need anything, Hana?

4
00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:23.727
Hana: Yes, I'd like to buy some postcards for Daddy and Hada.

5
00:00:23.728 --> 00:00:25.863
Sunny: What a good idea!

6
00:00:25.864 --> 00:00:30.756
Let's look in this shop.

7
00:00:30.757 --> 00:00:32.957
Hana: Here is a nice one.

8
00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:36.224
It shows the Golden Gate Bridge.

9
00:00:36.225 --> 00:00:39.152
Sunny: That's beautiful!

10
00:00:39.153 --> 00:00:42.524
Hana: I'll take these.

11
00:00:42.525 --> 00:00:47.000
Hana: Dear Daddy and Hada, [n3@How are you?

12
00:00:47.001 --> 00:00:49.911
Hana: I miss you very much.

13
00:00:49.912 --> 00:00:54.161
We are having lots of fun in America.

14
00:00:54.162 --> 00:00:57.526
Mom: Do you want some cookies, Hana?

15
00:00:57.527 --> 00:01:00.784
Tom: Hey, Hana! What did you do today?

16
00:01:00.785 --> 00:01:04.615
Hana: I wrote a postcard to my daddy and Hada.

17
00:01:04.616 --> 00:01:07.908
Hana: Can you take me to the post office?

18
00:01:07.909 --> 00:01:13.178
Tom: Sure thing. Let's go.

19
00:01:13.179 --> 00:01:17.077
Clerk: Hello. What can I do for you today?

20
00:01:17.078 --> 00:01:20.977
Hana: I want to send this postcard to Korea.

21
00:01:20.978 --> 00:01:26.376
Clerk: Korea? Okay, that'll be 75 cents.

22
00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:30.139
Hana: Here you go.

23
00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:32.714
Mom: Did you send the postcard, Hana?

24
00:01:32.715 --> 00:01:36.204
Hana: Yes. I hope Daddy likes it.

25
00:01:36.205 --> 00:01:38.222
When will he get it?

26
00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:42.296
Tom: Probably in a week or so.

27
00:01:42.297 --> 00:01:49.563
Since Dad can't come to San Francisco, I sent San Francisco to him!
